flowchart TD
  step1["Record physical device/OS, exact signed organization build, push environment and staged network; request notification permission and test denied permission separately."]
  step2["While foreground, background and locked, have another participant start an incoming call and observe any intended OS surface/push behavior."]
  step3["During a joined call switch speaker/headset/Bluetooth, exercise an OS interruption and change Wi-Fi/mobile network."]
  step4["Revoke the device/session while background or locked, then foreground and try to rejoin."]
  record["Compare every expected result; record PASS, FAIL or BLOCKED for this run"]
  step1 --> step2
  step2 --> step3
  step3 --> step4
  step4 --> record
